          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Flurry Of Blows"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(flourish)\n\nFrequency: 1/turn\n\nThe acolyte makes two unarmed Strikes, or one unarmed Strike and a dueling pistol Strike. If both hit the same creature, combine their damages for the purposes of resistances and weaknesses. The acolyte's multiple attack penalty applies normally to these Strikes."
            },
